00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:28.914
But what I wanted to do me myself
as Patricia and this is a for

00:19:28.914 --> 00:19:34.149
me was a very, very, very valued
the support that I got from Stanford.

00:19:34.149 --> 00:19:35.664
&gt;&gt; And Sita.

00:19:35.664 --> 00:19:39.535
&gt;&gt; Yeah, I don't know if my videos still
