me but I'll just keep talking.

00:19:41.232 --> 00:19:46.211
[LAUGH] So yeah, I very similar and
still different to

00:19:46.211 --> 00:19:50.739
Patricia I would say
also very entrepreneurial

00:19:50.739 --> 00:19:55.390
approach very many different
paths that I used.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.924
I actually started using
the network before the GSB.

00:19:58.924 --> 00:20:03.866
I encourage all of you guys to think
