00:22:57.137 --> 00:23:02.937
So I think that obviously sort of
was encouraging as I was looking for

00:23:02.937 --> 00:23:06.330
new opportunities in Europe.

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:11.504
And then in terms of how different
serve maybe differentiates you,

00:23:11.504 --> 00:23:17.331
but how does a Stanford MBA shaped the way
you think about your job or issues.

00:23:17.331 --> 00:23:22.931
I think something that I retained
from a lot of their classes that

00:23:22.931 --> 00:23:28.959
I took was going back to your aspiration
