not the business school.

00:27:12.713 --> 00:27:17.982
That's obviously been a huge
helping factor in just being

00:27:17.982 --> 00:27:22.720
knowledgeable about the space
that I want to enter.

00:27:22.720 --> 00:27:27.282
Also helped me understand that I
personally wasn't going to be coming in as

00:27:27.282 --> 00:27:28.787
