00:31:14.630 --> 00:31:18.041
Just understand what's
going on their side,

00:31:18.041 --> 00:31:23.377
both like within your friend's community,
your previous employers,

00:31:23.377 --> 00:31:28.288
just being in the loop and
understand what's going on helps a lot.

00:31:28.288 --> 00:31:33.720
And besides that I'm not sure how
