of Businesses, MBA programs.

00:31:45.608 --> 00:31:50.962
And we actually got friends and I've got
a lot of friends during that period.

00:31:50.962 --> 00:31:54.432
We just applied together to
different universities and

00:31:54.432 --> 00:31:59.449
I got admitted to Stanford, somebody told
me to two other great universities and

00:31:59.449 --> 00:32:02.208
we came back and
we our kids are friends now.

00:32:02.208 --> 00:32:07.254
And it's just fun,
just talking to the people who

00:32:07.254 --> 00:32:12.556
share the same ideas and
have the same backgrounds.

00:32:12.556 --> 00:32:16.700
And also I also did
the store among different

00:32:16.700 --> 00:32:20.850
